<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Culture &amp; Lifestyle</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-cul</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-cul" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1441?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-cul" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Germany news: Many believe Merkel more capable than Merz</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:213170653f5a23dee75c873fc44ae86c4e76b9117fa7c2370e8b459287607f28</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T08:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-many-believe-merkel-more-capable-than-merz/live-79528092--f23ed5eb8e52.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-many-believe-merkel-more-capable-than-merz/live-79528092?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nearly half of Germans view former Chancellor Angela Merkel as better suited to handle Germany's challenges than current Chancellor Friedrich Merz. Also, today is the last day of Oktoberfest in Munich. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>This island in Kiribati could be the key to solve the Amelia Earhart mystery</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:302e340a53d94906ece0e4757305f79e219e87f28a2dd4c80e0db0008d59088e</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T11:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/this-island-in-kiribati-could-be-the-key-to-solve-the-amelia-earhart-mystery/a-79517455--5be17a2d6029.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/this-island-in-kiribati-could-be-the-key-to-solve-the-amelia-earhart-mystery/a-79517455?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nearly 90 years after US aviator Amelia Earhart vanished over the Pacific, a new expedition to the remote island of Nikumaroro hopes a lagoon anomaly could finally reveal the fate of her missing aircraft.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Servers at Munich's iconic Oktoberfest call for more respect</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f645a4432a740ead1779825bcfe9e9e7ccf9fe97d3f70c6bd2cd866b2c03072b</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T13:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/servers-at-munich-s-iconic-oktoberfest-call-for-more-respect/a-79491207--cd91ce591124.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/servers-at-munich-s-iconic-oktoberfest-call-for-more-respect/a-79491207?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Oktoberfest is famous the world over for beer, brass band music and Bavarian traditions. But staff are also reporting incidents of racism and sexism, and are taking a stand against discrimination.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>South Park satirist pushes for accountability in Cornell gang-rape lawsuit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f03fb09cce6ece0f0f30073e622fbc71d7859456d828058c4a4dc33b688aaf27</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T14:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-park-satirist-pushes-for-accountability-in-cornell-gang-rape-lawsuit/a-79475382--e2bb4e991ce2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-park-satirist-pushes-for-accountability-in-cornell-gang-rape-lawsuit/a-79475382?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Writer Toby Morton is using a new website to amplify allegations in a high-profile sexual assault lawsuit involving seven Cornell students. The reopening of the case is causing an outcry on social media.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>"NAZA": Israeli military issues statement on film</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:737f7e58969700df4a06e02939e765cc1bc6b5e39a1dc4d9ee5f694dbfd2e06b</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T15:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/naza-israeli-military-issues-statement-on-film/a-79520483--c29108607d5e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/naza-israeli-military-issues-statement-on-film/a-79520483?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The award-winning documentary "NAZA" continues to spark controversy in Israel. The Israeli military has now published a multi-page statement calling the film's portrayal "distorted."</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>This extremely successful author polarizes German readers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae1210e49270c6443f47d2f6eb7020abe60c30ab8dd1ec06f4c6aaf45ab8ee69</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T07:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452--1ca180b39c00.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">She's young and she says what she thinks: Caroline Wahl is topping Germany's bestseller lists with her novels. But she has also faced a public backlash.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Campus Project 2026: Georgia takes center stage</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3e15c3335e47b8e426b2b04877a033d4df19722f687c164290b0f314cb1aa99f</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T09:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/campus-project-2026-georgia-takes-center-stage/a-79380639--efaea8063cd9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/campus-project-2026-georgia-takes-center-stage/a-79380639?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Beethovenfest exchange project brings German and Georgian musical traditions together. And the reasons go beyond music.</summary><category term="NRS-Import" /></entry><entry><title>DW shows solidarity with Georgians' commitment to democracy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c139cbac82408e24c5c6edbe65520f2c285d8bf4af02736e3c72af71fd2924c2</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T15:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/dw-shows-solidarity-with-georgians-commitment-to-democracy/a-79432731--f6945c635292.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/dw-shows-solidarity-with-georgians-commitment-to-democracy/a-79432731?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Cultural and media professionals in Georgia remain under threat. A DW panel brings together insiders who share their hopes and fears.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Beethoven and Andy Warhol: Rebel icons on show in Bonn</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a7599c34a92443615c667a304762143efa5cc4bff318bb9bf65498cba565eab8</id><updated>2026-10-05T17:14:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T12:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/beethoven-and-andy-warhol-rebel-icons-on-show-in-bonn/a-79296944--59ad6d6535a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/beethoven-and-andy-warhol-rebel-icons-on-show-in-bonn/a-79296944?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The new exhibition "Beethoven by Warhol" at the Beethoven House in Bonn presents the pop artist's late masterpiece: a picture of Ludwig van Beethoven. The exhibition shares the story of the work with the public.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Pay to ghost your boss: Japan's resignation business</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dcb0f83845acf5a3d77e5785316